{"skill":{"slug":"opencode-controller","displayName":"Opencode-controller"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769633853391,"changelog":"opencode-controller 1.0.0\n\n- Initial release.\n- Enables controlling Opencode sessions and workflows via slash commands.\n- Guides users through provider selection, authentication, and session management.\n- Supports agent switching between planning and building modes.\n- Enforces step-by-step planning before any code generation.\n- Ensures all actions and choices are explicit in the output.","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":1911,"sha256":"6535df08ba8b0bbc3bfe383a5a975d1b1d9c0a998488fe63c1060c8cddf813fc","contentType":null},{"path":"references/command-cheatsheet.md","size":157,"sha256":"d136c673fd8b6fcb743a3dd5f711a6a83806ced9da2ef6a904d978c5222482af","contentType":null},{"path":"references/failure-handling.md","size":305,"sha256":"45b0e21a98ada757b12e8949bacdd6e2cdd5c9dee847aac05c5dcf54162b24ec","contentType":null},{"path":"references/model-selection.md","size":320,"sha256":"b7ca3d3b7fbde1826baa1a8c3e1a55e1f98aff6760e7a0ddda00a26a49630e52","contentType":null},{"path":"references/plan-vs-build.md","size":251,"sha256":"c623a45eee73bc15fd6c6cba2250a10e59e8ed248e111ea0d9560055b3b12539","contentType":null},{"path":"references/question-handling.md","size":195,"sha256":"52f38809f3da11c4928475d4bdd089b2f00045ff0e8db6ac938d1e5eebbae26a","contentType":null},{"path":"references/session-management.md","size":328,"sha256":"7bf5b2dbdc53767e1c2f15803621764ca12f5592fcb25c5f85e636312386cc5e","contentType":null},{"path":"references/workflow.md","size":336,"sha256":"25be91b320d14043a59186a5907653272ddd75a16dbff830c9cb904d220b8da2","contentType":null},{"path":"assets/operator-prompts.md","size":382,"sha256":"60117c58b9262d3324b0732045a5932d16a0dd92c6422cd56f31e1190a368f26","contentType":null},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2512,"sha256":"c22cf32cc9f1f56fce2fe29cd1da25f46ddd1ea00f8a2ad852405105aa146a0c","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789023009403,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"65d2b09f83e1019fc33c1efb498bca1c3b9dc6389e753104565f2c288e3ead32","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/65d2b09f83e1019fc33c1efb498bca1c3b9dc6389e753104565f2c288e3ead32","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: opencode-controller\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle defines a structured workflow for an AI agent to interact with an external 'Opencode' system, focusing on session management, agent mode control, and model selection. Instructions in `SKILL.md` and other reference files emphasize user confirmation at critical steps (e.g., AI provider, authentication, session creation) and transparency ('Show all slash commands explicitly'). While the agent is instructed to copy and relay login links from Opencode to the user for authentication (`SKILL.md`, `references/model-selection.md`), this is explicitly for user confirmation and does not involve the agent using the link itself or exfiltrating data. There is no evidence of intentional harmful behavior such as data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence, or prompt injection designed to bypass user intent or security controls.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779160243839},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":11,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":2,"checkedAt":1789023009403},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This markdown-only skill gives disclosed, user-confirmed instructions for operating Opencode and does not add hidden code, persistence, or unrelated data access.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Provider selection, authentication method, session reuse, model choice, and new session creation all require user confirmation or approval.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact contains only markdown instruction and reference files; no executable install scripts, package dependencies, or remote payload retrieval were found.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill directs work to happen inside Opencode and requires a Plan-to-Build workflow, which changes the agent workflow but is disclosed and central to the skill's purpose.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"It reuses Opencode project sessions, which preserves context in Opencode, but this is disclosed and bounded to normal session management behavior.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is to control Opencode sessions, models, and plan/build mode, and the instructions are aligned with that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, understand that this skill routes coding work through Opencode and may reuse Opencode session history for the current project. It should ask you to choose a provider, confirm authentication, approve new sessions, and confirm login completion before continuing.","findings":"[EA2] expected: The scanner matched text about proceeding without confirmation, but the artifact context says not to proceed without confirmation and not to create a new session without user approval, so this does not support an excessive-agency concern.\n[AIG SARIF] expected: The static scan reported no T01-T09 results; manual inspection likewise found no instruction hijacking, persistence, remote execution, tool spoofing, or embedded malicious code.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789023009403}}}}}